Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:12.500 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  [Music]  ecuadorian special forces  storm a maximum security prison in the  country's south  [Music]  pizza pizza  they shout at the inmates to get on the  ground  and fire tear gas in a bid to bring the  riot under control  [Music]  inmates are seen covering themselves  from the choking fumes  while others are arrested  there's a chase as some of the prisoners  attempt a jailbreak  this dramatic video was released today  after riots broke out in three  prisons within these wars  rival gangs have turned on each other in  a battle for power and leadership  some fought with handmade weapons others  reportedly beheaded dozens of people  have been killed  the police and military remains  stationed outside waiakea letaconga and  cuenca  there are frequent riots and violence in  ecuador's prison system  but this has so far been the deadliest  i want my son out because he could get  killed the authorities want to hand him  over dead  no my son has asked me to get him out  because they want to kill him  i don't know anything about my son i was  sent a message  yesterday on the phone he always uses to  communicate and it said only we are all  locked up  that's it i sent another message but i  didn't receive a response  many worried that their loved ones  remain in danger  with gang disputes regularly spilling  into violence  inside the prison wars laura berdimani  al jazeera

